the future.\r\n\r\n# ADDED\r\n- **Multiple vaults** that can be accessed via overlay invoked with `F5` or via config, each vault can also be given names. Request #151 \r\n- **Zen mode** in edit view that focuses text at the center strips visual *distractions* and with toggleble **dimming**. Request #155 \r\n- **Text alignment** in edit view, you can now change the alignment of the text to `left`, `right`, `center` and `justified` via `F8` key.\r\n- **graf update**, bumped to `graf v1.0.1` which adds features focused on node rendering like `node_scale`, better text rendering and more, check [graf-rs](https://github.com/reekta92/graf-rs) for more details.\r\n\r\n# FIXED\r\n- Fixed issues #165 #168 #157 #152 \r\n- Fixed grep search not automatically activating in the search popup at notes view.","reactions":{"total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}}
